 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n애자와 관련한 다음 내용의 빈칸 ㉠, ㉡에 알맞은 것은?\n\n   차단기에 사용되는 애자는 절연내력이 ( ㉠   ),\n\n   정전용량이 ( ㉡  )한다.\n\n\n        ㉠          ㉡\n\n ①     작으며        작아야\n\n ②     작으며         커야\n\n ③     크며         작아야\n\n ④     크며         커야","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.02.22 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p1-e04-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e04-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":657},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e04-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":814}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P071-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.02.22 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n다음과 같은 조건의 3상 선로에 설치해야할 차단기의\n\n차단용량은 몇 MVA인가?\n\n  ⦁수전단 전압  : 22kV  ⦁단락전류 6000A \n\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.02.22 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p1-e04-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e04-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":658},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e04-m19-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1068}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P071-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.02.22 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n다음과 같은 조건에 대한 퍼센트 임피던스는?\n\n ⦁정격용량  : 50MVA  ⦁선간전압  : 250kV\n\n ⦁한 상의 선로 임피던스  : 200Ω\n\n\n\n① 16          ② 20\n\n③ 25          ④ 40","source":{"collection"